From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Oleksii Kulinich <entaytion@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 17:37:06 +0300
Subject: Add a "Delete Failed Proxies" action to the proxy list

Stock only offers deleting everything (and only once you have 10+ saved) or
deleting one at a time by hand. There was no way to clear out just the ones
that failed their last availability check while keeping the working ones.

- new row next to "Delete All Proxies", shown whenever at least one saved
  proxy is checked and unavailable
- only removes proxies where availableCheckTime != 0 (actually checked, not
  "never checked yet") and !available
- if the currently active proxy happens to be among the ones removed, drops
  back to no-proxy the same way "Delete All" already does; otherwise leaves
  the active connection alone
